Package: kali-anonsurf
Version: 1.4.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Und3rf10w
Installed-Size: 68
Depends: secure-delete, tor, iptables, init-system-helpers
Recommends: conntrack-tools | conntrack, socat, bleachbit, i2p, proxychains, openvpn, gufw, gtkdialog
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Parrot stealth and anon scripts, ported to work with Kali Linux
 Transparent Tor proxy for the whole system, plus the Pandora RAM cleaner.
 Network state is kept in the anonsurf owned iptables chains ANONSURF_NAT and
 ANONSURF_OUT, so UFW, Docker and VPN rules are never flushed. DNS is handled
 through systemd-resolved, resolvconf or /etc/resolv.conf, depending on the
 host, and the previous state is restored by 'anonsurf stop'.
